{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAxLS0yMDEwL0NoYWwlMjBDaGFsYSUyMENoYWwlMjAlMjgyMDA5JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Chal Chala Chal","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/F5JAxSxdCCiIN1l8RjeIh0HA9B.jpg","description":"Pune-based widower Omkar Nath used to work as a Headmaster with a local school. When he was fired, his son, Deepak, hired a lawyer to sue the school. The school was represented by none other than Omkar's live-in son-in-law, Vinayak Agrawal. After some years the Court finally came to a decision and the verdict was in favor of Omkar. However, since the school had no funds, it was directed to surrender it's school bus in lieu of wages. Deepak takes charge of this bus, finds out it's dilapidated and makes it roadworthy. He also decides to ply in on the Sonawadi - Ratna Chowk route, not knowing that his problems are just about to start.\n\nReleased 6 Feb 2009 · IN · Language: Hindi · 138 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2009","genres":["Drama","Comedy","Romance","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.5","imdb_id":"tt1438486","moviedb_id":37671,"tmdbId":37671,"runtime":"138 min","cast":["Om Puri","Govinda","Rajpal Yadav","Asif Basra","Reema Sen","Razak Khan","Murali Sharma","Manoj Joshi"],"released":"2009-02-06T00:00:00.000Z","country":"IN","language":"Hindi","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Om Puri","character":"Omkar Nath","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3xENmjr7CA8ACRViHnjOI5jPQUt.jpg"},{"name":"Govinda","character":"Deepak O. Nath","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jIY8akWgvhgbIgZDd20yIPFDSv8.jpg"},{"name":"Rajpal Yadav","character":"Sunder","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aJJAU9EPiiXRsWDuy60mXE8U6lT.jpg"},{"name":"Asif Basra","character":"Harilal","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dHxkTrfEnreC77vRS0SVtaebDQI.jpg"},{"name":"Reema Sen","character":"Payal Ghosh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/f5Xe92gA1BXa4BddAxnysRZwnjf.jpg"},{"name":"Razak Khan","charact